        "@value": "An immersive theatrical experience by the beloved indie performance company bluemouth inc. exploring the borders that divide and unite us, within the framework of a live podcast. Created and performed by Lucy Simic, Mariel Marshall, Stephen O'Connell, Peter Musante."
